#: kdm-dlg.cpp:101
msgid "Sho&w logo"
msgstr "Vertoon embleem"

#: kdm-dlg.cpp:112
msgid ""
"You can choose to display a custom logo (see below), a clock or no logo at "
"all."
msgstr ""
"Jy kan kies om pasmaak embleem te vertoon (sien onder), 'n horlosie of geen "
"embleem nie."

#: kdm-dlg.cpp:118
msgid "&Logo:"
msgstr "Embleem:"

#: kdm-dlg.cpp:128
msgid ""
"Click here to choose an image that KDM will display. You can also drag and "
"drop an image onto this button (e.g. from Konqueror)."
msgstr ""
"Kliek hier om 'n beeld te kies wat KDM sal vertoon. Jy kan ook 'n beeld trek "
"en laat val op hierdie knoppie (Bv. van Konqueror)."

